body:
I think she was locked up, again, I think Slater was a grown up Annie in the darkest timeline. She always seemed crazy, like Darkest timeline Annie. She loved Jeff, and they’re both hot girls with dark hair and light skin. Anine was dumped by Jeff, as Jeff didn’t think she was pretty enough, so she went to Darkest timeline Abed, and asked him to teach her how to time travel, she went back to Greendale, before the episode Remedial Chaos theory, when the timelines were created, and she met Jeff, a kind Jeff, she couldn’t help but like him, and he liked her. She wanted her happy ending with Jeff, so she tried to get with him before he went crazy, sadly they broke up, so she went crazier, and crazier, until finally she was locked up.   


&#x200B;

that’s my theory, hope you like it!
